(b) The owner or his agent of a building undergoing new construction or repair or renovation who is entitled to an exemption as specified in subsection (a)(2), (3) or (4) of this section shall obtain the exemption by applying at the office of the building inspector. A fee as determined from time to time by the city council shall be charged for the inspection and issuance of such exemption.
(Ord. No. 91-002, § 5, 3-7-1991)

